---
import SiteLayout from "../layouts/SiteLayout.astro";
---
<SiteLayout title="Privacy Policy | AutoPet" description="AutoPet's privacy policy explains what information this static website handles.">
  <article class="page">
    <p class="eyebrow">Last updated November 6, 2026</p>
    <h1>Privacy policy</h1>
    <p>AutoPet is a static information website. We do not operate user accounts, collect information through forms, or use advertising trackers on this site.</p>
    <h2>Information handled by website providers</h2>
    <p>Our hosting provider may process standard request information, such as IP address, browser details, and requested pages, to deliver and protect the website. Refer to the provider's privacy documentation for its retention and processing practices.</p>
    <h2>Links to other sites</h2>
    <p>Our pages may link to retailers and other third-party websites. Those sites have their own privacy policies and practices. AutoPet does not control how they handle your information.</p>
    <h2>Changes and contact</h2>
    <p>We may update this notice when the site changes. Questions can be sent to <a href="mailto:hello@autopet.store">hello@autopet.store</a>.</p>
  </article>
</SiteLayout>
<style>
  .page { width: min(760px, calc(100% - 2rem)); margin: auto; padding-block: 3rem; }
  .eyebrow { color: var(--teal); font-weight: 750; }
  h2 { margin-top: 2rem; font-size: 1.5rem; }
</style>
